---
description: Meaningful-task review, clean code and documentation checkpoint
alwaysApply: true
---

Use the shared workflow in `docs/quality-checkpoints.md` at meaningful implementation boundaries.
Run `pnpm finish-work --provider cursor` once the task is ready for a final quality pass.
Do not run it after every conversational turn. Hooks also record activity for the delayed worker.
The command uses model intelligence to review, fix/clean, update docs and verify the result.
When `VANTAGE_QUALITY_CHILD=1`, follow the provided stage prompt; never run finish-work recursively.
